== §4.1 sites
https://example.com                           -> https://example.com
https://example.com/login?next=/#top          -> https://example.com
HTTPS://Login.Example.COM/                    -> https://login.example.com
https://example.com:443                       -> https://example.com
http://example.com:80/x                       -> http://example.com
https://example.com:8443/                     -> https://example.com:8443
http://example.com:443                        -> http://example.com:443
https://user:pass@example.com/                -> https://example.com
  https://example.com                         -> https://example.com
https://bücher.example                       -> https://xn--bcher-kva.example
https://BÜCHER.example/path                  -> https://xn--bcher-2pa.example
https://münchen.de                           -> https://xn--mnchen-3ya.de
https://例え.テスト                      -> https://xn--r8jz45g.xn--zckzah
https://xn--bcher-kva.example                 -> https://xn--bcher-kva.example
https://[::1]:8080/                           -> https://[::1]:8080
https://router                                -> https://router
android://com.example.app                     -> android://com.example.app
android://AbCd_ef==@com.example.app/          -> android://com.example.app
ftp://example.com                             refused: not an http, https or android site
example.com                                   refused: not a URL
https://                                      refused: the site has no host
https://exa mple.com                          refused: the host has a character a host cannot hold
https://example..com                          refused: a host label is not 1 to 63 bytes
https://example.com:0                         refused: the port is not 1 to 65535
https://example.com:65536                     refused: the port is not 1 to 65535
https://example.com:http                      refused: the port is not a number
https://ex%41mple.com                         refused: the host has a character a host cannot hold
android://1com.example                        refused: not an Android package name
android://com..example                        refused: not an Android package name

