== §2, §7.1 round trips
login: 512 bytes, multiple of 256 true, round trip true
  {"kind":"login","title":"GitHub","urls":["https://github.com","android://com.github.android"],"username":"me@example.com","password":"correct horse battery staple","notes":"line one\nline \"two\", with a comma","totp":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","modified":1760500000,"future":[1,"x"]}
login with a field: 512 bytes, multiple of 256 true, round trip true
  {"kind":"login","title":"GitHub","urls":["https://github.com","android://com.github.android"],"username":"me@example.com","password":"correct horse battery staple","notes":"line one\nline \"two\", with a comma","totp":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","fields":[{"name":"PIN","value":"1234","secret":true,"future":2}],"modified":1760500000,"future":[1,"x"]}
passkey: 512 bytes, multiple of 256 true, round trip true
  {"kind":"passkey","rpId":"github.com","credentialId":"AAECAwQFBgcICQoLDA0ODxAREhMUFRYXGBkaGxwdHh8","userHandle":"AP91c2Vy","userName":"me@example.com","userDisplayName":"Me","algorithm":-7,"privateKey":"__79_Pv6-fj39vX08_Lx8O_u7ezr6uno5-bl5OPi4eA","login":"aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa","created":1760400000,"modified":1760500000,"future":true}
a login over 256 bytes pads to 768
key fields differ by kind true; a title change keeps them true
modified 1760500000 7

== §2, §7.1 CORRUPT
not JSON                         not JSON
not UTF-8                        not UTF-8
array                            not a JSON object
no kind                          kind is not login, note or passkey
kind other                       kind is not login, note or passkey
no password                      password is missing or not a string
password an int                  password is missing or not a string
empty password                   password is 1 to 1024 bytes
password 1025 bytes              password is 1 to 1024 bytes
password 1024 bytes              accepted
empty title                      title is 1 to 256 bytes
title 257 bytes                  title is 1 to 256 bytes
urls not strings                 urls is missing or not an array of strings
33 urls                          urls holds at most 32 sites
url with a path                  a url is not a site (§4.1)
url upper case                   a url is not a site (§4.1)
notes over 64 KiB                notes is at most 64 KiB
totp not an id                   totp is neither empty nor a record id
no modified                      modified is missing or not an integer
modified a float                 modified is missing or not an integer
rpId upper case                  rpId is not a lower-case A-label domain
rpId with port                   rpId is not a lower-case A-label domain
rpId IDN                         rpId is not a lower-case A-label domain
rpId A-label                     accepted
credentialId 31 bytes            credentialId is not 32 bytes
credentialId padded              credentialId is not base64url without padding
credentialId std base64          credentialId is not base64url without padding
userHandle empty                 userHandle is 1 to 64 bytes
userHandle 65 bytes              userHandle is 1 to 64 bytes
userName 257 bytes               userName is at most 256 bytes
algorithm -8                     algorithm is not -7
privateKey 33 bytes              privateKey is not 32 bytes
login not an id                  login is neither empty nor a record id
no created                       created is missing or not an integer
padded with spaces               accepted
reasons naming a secret: 0

